  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Donor Team South Sudan 2012-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Joint Donor Team Sydsudan 2012-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JDT is a pilot-collaboration for improving aid effectiveness in       post-conflict environment in accordance with the OECD / DAC Fragile   States Principles. Participants are CAN, DAN, NL, NOR, SWE and UK.    JDT represent these donors in key development and sector forums, incl the Steering Committee of the Multi-Donor Trust Fund South Sudan, and acted as secretariat for the Capacity Building Trust Fund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JDT &#xe4;r ett pionj&#xe4;rsamarbete f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet i           post-konfliktmilj&#xf6; i enlighet med OECD/DACs Fragile States            Principles. De deltagande l&#xe4;nderna &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rutom Sverige; CAN, DAN, NL,  NOR och UK. JDT representerar dessa sex givarl&#xe4;nder i viktiga         bist&#xe5;nds- och sektorfora, inkl i styrkommitt&#xe9;n f&#xf6;r Multi-Donor Trust  Fund&#x2013;South Sudan, samt agerat sekretariat f&#xf6;r Capacity Building Trust</narrative>
  </description>
